Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:37.84,PZ - S,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\3c&HF17F66&\t(0,1565,0\3c&H000000&)\pos(10,160)}*會不會是堀你太吃醋了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:37.84,PZ - S,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\3c&HF17F66&\pos(10,210)}*別放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:37.84,PZ - S,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\3c&HF17F66&\t(0,1565,0\3c&H000000&)\pos(10,260)}*男人都這樣啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,PZ,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.75,0:21:12.62,PZ,,0,0,0,,{\fn華康新綜藝體 Std W7\\c&H1B1E28&\pos(1494.666,489.334)}消\N滅\N證\N據
